msgid "RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM and SBUS. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:174
#: 0aa42012e18f4f35a688f663c3550926
msgid "SBUS connects to the SBUS pad which inverts the input and applies it to to R2 input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:176
#: a5a855a671c243abbca8142220cc9fbb
msgid "FPort requires connection to T2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:178
#: 00cdf2277106432d924f07f269f44880
msgid "CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:180
#: 0943f1b982a745268457f62f85579701
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:182
#: 967b88809490464d83796d18314c2c33
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:185
#: 03ef12eea8984bcaa907d74a1a148d13
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:187
#: 82a5c4c970f64210aefd8db93dae84ae
msgid "The FoxeerF405v2  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on UART4. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can be used simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:190
#: 5c6aaad583044713818498f9fa756603
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:192
#: 8306fd091871483aab5a8fa7f8a0b3f8
msgid "The FoxeerF405v2 supports up to 10 PWM outputs (PWM 9  is defaulted to serial LED support). Outputs are available via two JST-SH connectors. All outputs support DShot,as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:194
#: 9df03af61d7a46ccbfa8fad20b6dd983
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:196
#: 19f6077d2f5446ab9c5d9f732af5569e
msgid "PWM 1, 4 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:197
#: 5471f94d0aa44ea0b5a6c51226266a5f
msgid "PWM 2, 3 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:198
#: a011a7d44c374cfdbbcba09ee85e6778
msgid "PWM 6-8  in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:199
#: dec9110a5ae14cf3a6f3d150024b9c73
msgid "PWM 5, 9 (LED) in group4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:200
#: eef5105bb3e744ebb4310f2c8a58eff9
msgid "PWM 10 in group5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:202
#: df062e811e7243228ca679a5b286157f
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:206
#: 08c4b49a05c54d4fa9cb4b04c801e616
msgid "by default PWM9 is configured as an LED output, making PWM5 only usable as a serial LED also. You can re-assign PWM9's function to something else if you wish to use PWM5 normally."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:208
#: d60672ba8f3e455e9f7fe48f36d72ef5
msgid "for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:210
#: 2ed5f26a16444eab98f15c09a96a98f9
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:211
#: dbb578a72b1348d08f05a38c627e8b67
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:214
#: 1a832a5ea91342fd9bfb7fe5747472ab
msgid "GPIO and Camera Switch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:216
#: 0f649ba1e69243babe21eff49bc7bbe7
msgid "GPIO pin 70 is the SER pad and is assigned by default to RELAY2 functionality. This pin can be controlled via GCS or by RC transmitter using the :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:218
#: 29fc4c25f878494c96bc5e528675faa2
msgid "Camera input can be switched between CAM1 input and CA2 input using GPIO 71 which is assigned by default to the RELAY3 functionality. It can be controlled like the GPIO above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:221
#: ede11f8857cb49c980eb477896e75156
msgid "LED Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:223
#: bb75dd7abdd74c308d998298b63a0af5
msgid "The LED output is configured by default to support :ref:`NeoPixel LED strings<common-serial-led-neopixel>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf405v2.rst:226
